# trap — 16x16, a floor plate with teeth.
#
# Reads as *danger, but not alive*: it is square and static where the wardens are rounded and
# moving, and it uses a rust-red nothing else in the arena touches. Sits flat on the floor, so the
# plate fills the tile and only the teeth rise out of it.
! . = 00000000   transparent
! k = 1a1118ff   outline
! p = 39222aff   plate
! r = 6e2b30ff   rust
! t = c4626aff   tooth
kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk
kppppppppppppppk
kprrrrrrrrrrrrpk
kpr.t..t..t..rpk
kpr.t..t..t..rpk
kpr..........rpk
